     "<div dir=\"ltr\">See: <a href=\"http://bioconductor.org/packages/release/bioc/vignettes/Cardinal/inst/doc/Cardinal-2-guide.html#region-of-interest-selection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bioconductor.org/packages/release/bioc/vignettes/Cardinal/inst/doc/Cardinal-2-guide.html%23region-of-interest-selection&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793240922489000&amp;usg=AOvVaw36A5WVJ6ThAVFRSZmtEMO_\">http://bioconductor.org/packages/release/bioc/vignettes/Cardinal/inst/doc/Cardinal-2-guide.html#region-of-interest-selection</a><div><br></div><div>-Kylie</div></div>"
